---
source: pkgs/djson/src/parser/mod.rs
expression: cases
---
adjacent top-level tokens
input: `key key`
error: `unexpected token`

arithmetic expression as key
input: `1 + 1: 1`
error: `invalid key`

call expression as key
input: `x(): 1`
error: `invalid key`

member expression as key
input: `x.foo(): 1`
error: `invalid key`

multi-word unquoted key
input: `let there be rain: 1`
error: `unexpected token`

reserved identifier
input: `let let = 1`
error: `reserved identifier`

non-identifier binding name
input: `let 1 = 1`
error: `unexpected token`
